<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why Reyrolle 7SR119?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>The Reyrolle 7SR119 is a retrofit solution, replacing older Argus 7SG1114 devices with a modern 7SR11. This four-pole non-directional overcurrent protection device provides essential protection, monitoring, instrumentation and metering for your switchgear. </p><p>Replacing legacy protection devices often involves significant disruption, complex re-wiring and new case installations. The 7SR119 minimizes these challenges with quick, easy installation. It eliminates new panel cutouts or changes to existing wiring, saving hours of engineering and commissioning time. </p><p>Enjoy protection features like undercurrent and arc flash detection, improving operational safety and reliability. Robust self-monitoring and support for standard Reyrolle tools help deliver reliable performance. This modern numeric relay provides peace of mind and continued protection for your assets.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='54WdNJjXaabt2UkldpLRmZ' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='54WdNJjXaabt2UkldpLRmZ'>
